  SEC[policy/security] --> ALR
  PLAN --> DEC[core/decision]
  DEC -->|AUTOMATE| TX[remediation/runner]
  DEC -->|APPROVAL| APR[approvals]
  APR --> TX
  TX --> EXE[remediation/executor] --> WORLD[simulation/world or real host]
  TX --> PRB[remediation/verification]
  TX --> CHAT[chatops/notifier]
  TX --> AUD[core/audit]
  RISK[risk/engine] --> SEC
  IDN[identity/confidence] --> RISK
  LEASE[leases/engine] --> FW[firewall adapter]
  POL[policy/evaluator] --> LEASE
